This folder contains all the Matlab scripts we use to analyse the radichromic films

FILES EXPLANATION

==> CalibrationRCF.m
This script can be used to calibrate in dose a set of radiochromic. It takes RCF images and the corresponding doses values and returns a calibration 
curve with the fitting parameters. The output is stored in a file that can be read by other scripts (like the ReadRadiochromicDose.m) where the calibration is needed

==> ReadRadiochromicDose.m

